    {
      "Seq": 11,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 8068,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself walking along the hedgerow, in the morning, as I did when I was gathering mushrooms. The thorny hedgerow standing between two open stretches reminds me of the looters who raided where I lived, their presence still lingering in my thoughts. I look upon a hare, its ears long and sandy, flattened against its head as it sniffles the air, drawing a parallel to the time I played in the fields, ears flat against my skull to hide from looters.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 12,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 8068,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I notice the long-eared sandy hare, its ears flat against its head, nose working the air. I want to breathe in the scent that comes with it, a simple pleasure of the land, and rely on the ways of the countryside folk to understand its best hour.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 13,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 8068,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I lost the scent of the fresh earth, a hare\u0027s breath, as I dug in the soil. Thoughts slipped from my mind, like seeds not planted well.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "breathe in the smell of the hare",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 14,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 8068,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I remember gathering mushrooms among the trees, and this oak\u0027s deep fissures and heavy boughs echo the patterns I once saw in the earth\u0027s crust, drawing a quiet parallel between then and now. I let my focus go, where once I wandered the fields, ignoring the harvest in favor of play.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
