    {
      "Seq": 16,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I find myself walking along the hedgerow, in the morning, as I did when I was gathering mushrooms. This place is a long thorny hedgerow standing between two open stretches. Around me are a gate bar, a hare, an oak tree, a beetle, and a water meadow. I step closer to the bush, my hand instinctively reaching out to pluck a drupelet. The memory of gathering mushrooms in the dense thicket, its thorns a sharp reminder of survival, echoes softly in my thoughts.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 17,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I notice a sagging five-bar gate, its top rail rubbed smooth by leaning. Its colour and scent, as they swell to their point, draw me to examine the gate bar closely. I will rely on the plain ways of country folk, knowing that waiting has its price, but this hour is right for such scrutiny.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 18,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I want to pass through, not stand and stare at the gate bar. Hens cackle as I haul the pail, the soil soft under my boots, the season\u0027s task waiting to be done.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 19,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I pass by the gate bar, its edge too sharp, not yet polished. Waiting past this moment will only darken its edge, and I think again, ready to move on. I could still examine the gate bar closely, another way. The carcasses\u0027 scent, rich and heady, reminds me to cut them into joints now, before they go past their prime.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 20,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I failed to examine the gate bar closely. Due to this, my thoughts scattered like meat lost from a cleanly cut joint.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "examine the gate bar closely",
      "Succeeded": false
    },
    {
      "Seq": 21,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 5,
      "Place": "Plain",
      "Area": "Hedgerow",
      "LocationId": 32010,
      "Actor": "Eghbert Moorshield",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "My attention is drawn to a grassland. This is an open wind-swept grassland, the sky vast and unbroken above. I look upon a flower patch, recalling how I once gathered mushrooms here, the bright colours of wildflowers drawing me with the same instinctive pull. I turn to a dandelion, its seed globe ready to scatter, a childhood memory of gathering mushrooms to survive echoes in my mind.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 3,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": "",
      "Phrase": "",
      "Lesson": false,
      "Attempt": "",
      "Succeeded": false
